  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-244-273"><seg source="#source-244-273">秋の風　野面を渡る</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-273-290"><seg source="#source-273-290">さく　さく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-290-337"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-290-308"><rb>腕</rb><rt>かいな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-308-337">も軽し　早稲を刈る</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-337-359"><seg source="#source-337-359">この祭り日に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-359-394"><seg source="#source-359-394">たわわに実るありがたさ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-394-426"><seg source="#source-394-426">早出供米　他村に魁け</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-426-458"><seg source="#source-426-458">お国につくす稲を刈る</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-458-480"><seg source="#source-458-480">この祭り日に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-480-509"><seg source="#source-480-509">息子らは遠き戦野に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-509-532"><seg source="#source-509-532">村に居残る吾等</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-532-567"><seg source="#source-532-567">田畑引き受け　休みなし</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-567-585"><seg source="#source-567-585">この祭り日に</seg></p>
    </body>
